{
  "comment": [
    "Mutation proof for the UI-002 browser gate, to HYG-002's standard: each",
    "assertion must be shown to bind to something. For every mutation below, the",
    "named client defect is introduced and the gate must turn the named assertion",
    "red. An assertion that stays green under a mutation that breaks exactly what",
    "it claims to check is not a gate -- it is decoration, which is the class this",
    "ticket exists to correct.",
    "An assertion may carry more than one mutation. Review found that the build",
    "panel and live-refresh assertions each covered one call site while a second,",
    "unasserted one existed beside it, so 'exactly one mutation per assertion' was",
    "itself a way to leave a surface unproved.",
    "Each mutation is a literal substring replacement against the shipped client."
  ],
  "mutations": [
    {
      "name": "dashboard-rows-never-appended",
      "assertion": "desktop_dashboard_lists_builds",
      "file": "app.js",
      "find": "      row.append(id, state, created, open);\n      body.append(row);",
      "replace": "      row.append(id, state, created, open);"
    },
    {
      "name": "validate-button-unwired",
      "assertion": "desktop_pipeline_validate_accepts_valid_source",
      "file": "app.js",
      "find": "byId(\"validate-pipeline\").addEventListener(\"click\", () =>\n  action(() => api(`${projectPath()}/pipelines/validate`, { method: \"POST\", body: pretty(submission()) })));",
      "replace": "byId(\"validate-pipeline\").addEventListener(\"click\", () => undefined);"
    },
    {
      "name": "plan-button-unwired",
      "assertion": "desktop_pipeline_plan_renders_stages",
      "file": "app.js",
      "find": "byId(\"plan-pipeline\").addEventListener(\"click\", () =>\n  action(() => api(`${projectPath()}/pipelines/plan`, { method: \"POST\", body: pretty(submission()) })));",
      "replace": "byId(\"plan-pipeline\").addEventListener(\"click\", () => undefined);"
    },
    {
      "name": "save-pipeline-unwired",
      "assertion": "desktop_pipeline_save_and_submit",
